sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Business User
    participant Frontend as React SPA Frontend
    participant Api as ASP.NET Core API
    participant LearnerController as Learners Controller
    participant IngestionController as Data Ingestion Controller
    participant AppServices as Application Services
    participant Domain as Domain Model and Rules
    participant Infrastructure as Infrastructure Services
    participant Db as SQL Server / PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant External as External LMS / HR / Assessment Systems
    participant Audit as Audit and Health Checks

    rect rgb(231, 242, 253)
        User->>Frontend: Open dashboard or module link
        Frontend->>Api: HTTP request to API endpoint
        Api->>LearnerController: Route learner, dashboard, or intervention request
        LearnerController->>AppServices: Call learner profile service
        AppServices->>Infrastructure: Query persisted learner data
        Infrastructure->>Db: Read employees, attendance, assessments, risks
        Db-->>Infrastructure: Return records
        Infrastructure-->>AppServices: Return aggregated data
        AppServices->>Domain: Apply profile, risk, and intervention rules
        Domain-->>AppServices: Return business result
        AppServices-->>LearnerController: Return DTO response
        LearnerController-->>Api: HTTP 200 response
        Api-->>Frontend: JSON payload
        Frontend-->>User: Render learner progress, risk, and actions
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        External->>Api: Submit attendance, assessment, employee, or notes data
        Api->>IngestionController: Route ingestion request
        IngestionController->>AppServices: Start import and validation workflow
        AppServices->>Domain: Validate source, duplicates, required fields, and status
        Domain-->>AppServices: Return accepted records, errors, and reconciliation issues
        AppServices->>Infrastructure: Persist import batch, records, errors, and issues
        Infrastructure->>Db: Save ingestion results in one unit of work
        Db-->>Infrastructure: Commit completed
        Infrastructure-->>AppServices: Return ingestion status
        AppServices->>Audit: Record import outcome and operational event
        AppServices-->>IngestionController: Return ingestion result DTO
        IngestionController-->>Api: HTTP response
        Api-->>External: Import accepted, failed, or partially accepted
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
        Worker->>AppServices: Run scheduled risk/reporting job
        AppServices->>Infrastructure: Load latest learner and compliance data
        Infrastructure->>Db: Read operational data
        Db-->>Infrastructure: Return data set
        Infrastructure-->>AppServices: Return data set
        AppServices->>Domain: Recalculate risk, compliance, and intervention status
        Domain-->>AppServices: Return updated decisions
        AppServices->>Infrastructure: Persist snapshots, audit entries, and notifications
        Infrastructure->>Db: Save updates
        AppServices->>Audit: Publish health, audit, and job outcome signals
    end
